### Login to get token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test2@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### Get all events (empty initially)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a new event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Team Meeting",
  "description": "Weekly sync meeting",
  "startTime": "2025-11-27T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2025-11-27T11:00:00Z",
  "location": "Conference Room A"
}

### Get upcoming events (24 hours)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/events/upcoming
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get upcoming events (48 hours)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/events/upcoming?hours=48
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get events by date range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/events/range?startDate=2025-11-27T00:00:00Z&endDate=2025-11-28T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update event (replace {eventId} with actual ID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/events/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated Team Meeting",
  "location": "Conference Room B"
}

### Delete event (replace {eventId} with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test validation - missing title
POST http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "description": "Missing title",
  "startTime": "2025-11-27T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2025-11-27T11:00:00Z"
}

### Test validation - end time before start time
POST http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Invalid Times",
  "startTime": "2025-11-27T11:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2025-11-27T10:00:00Z"
}

### Test unauthorized access (no token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/calendar/events
